6. How do you handle checked exceptions inside a lambda?

Lambdas can’t throw checked exceptions directly unless declared in the functional interface.
Options:

Wrap checked exception in RuntimeException.

Create custom functional interface declaring throws.

Utility wrapper method to rethrow.

list.forEach(item -> {
    try { process(item); }
    catch(IOException e) { throw new UncheckedIOException(e); }
});

